I wouldn't bother with wishing for Magicbane when you are absent several
other useful items like the ring of levitation. Just blank a bunch of gimpy
potions and pray up a big pile of holy water. Keep one in a bag outside
your BoH to uncurse your BoH, and 5-10 inside the BoH. That should be
ample. On the ascension run, there are very few things where getting them
cursed is a serious problem. It doesn't really matter, for example, if your
hawaiian shirt gets cursed. It doesn't protect less, you jus can't take it
off (which you weren't planning on doing anyway, I would assume).

Cursing is really NOT all that common. When it hits, it can frequently hit
stuff that you don't really care about. Added protection is to go through
and bless every single last thing in your inventory. That means they need
to be hit twice to even be cursed at all. With Ls genocided, the utility of
Magicbane for -just- the run up through the dungeons is pretty small. Not
much compared to the utility of a ring of levitation in the plane of air,
for example.


